      episodeFormatRuleGuideContent: { t: 0, b: { t: 2, i: [{ t: 3 }], s: `Rules are matched from top to bottom, and the first matched rule will be used.
Write matching rules based on the actual filename structure:
Match fixed text directly, and mark the episode number with the named group (?&lt;ep&gt;...);
For other variable but position-sensitive parts, use named groups like (?&lt;a&gt;...) and (?&lt;b&gt;...).
Escape special characters such as [](). when they should be matched literally;
it is recommended to use ^ and $ to constrain the full filename, especially $, to avoid false positives from partial matches.` } },
